<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Choosimple is designed to help readers make clearer product decisions with less noise and fewer unnecessary comparisons.</p>
<p>This page explains what information may be collected when you visit Choosimple and how that information may be used.</p>
<h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
<p>Some links on Choosimple may be affiliate links. This means Choosimple may earn a commission if you purchase a product through certain links, at no additional cost to you.</p>
<p>As an Amazon Associate, Choosimple earns from qualifying purchases.</p>
<p>Affiliate relationships do not directly determine product decisions. Recommendations are based on product research, ownership patterns, reliability signals, usability, maintenance considerations, and overall value for most buyers.</p>
<h2>Analytics and Usage Data</h2>
<p>Choosimple may use analytics tools, hosting analytics, or similar services to understand general website traffic and usage patterns.</p>
<p>This may include information such as pages visited, approximate geographic region, browser type, device type, referral sources, and general interaction data.</p>
<p>This information is used to improve the website, understand which pages are useful, monitor performance, and improve the reader experience over time.</p>
<h2>Cookies and Tracking</h2>
<p>Third-party services, including affiliate programs, analytics providers, and retail partners, may use cookies or similar technologies to track website activity, affiliate referrals, or completed purchases.</p>
<p>You can usually manage, block, or delete cookies through your browser settings.</p>
<h2>Email Updates</h2>
<p>If you choose to subscribe to Choosimple updates, your email address may be used to send occasional updates about new product decisions, site improvements, or related content.</p>
<p>Your email address will not be sold to third parties.</p>
<h2>Third-Party Websites</h2>
<p>Choosimple links to third-party websites, including retailers, affiliate partners, and product pages. Choosimple is not responsible for the content, privacy practices, policies, or actions of external websites.</p>
<p>When you click a third-party link, you should review that website’s own privacy policy and terms.</p>
<h2>Data Security</h2>
<p>Choosimple aims to use reasonable measures to keep the website safe and reliable. However, no website or internet transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
<h2>Children’s Privacy</h2>
<p>Choosimple is not intended to collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal information through the site, please contact Choosimple so it can be addressed.</p>
<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>This privacy policy may be updated from time to time as Choosimple evolves, adds new features, or uses new tools or services.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, you can contact Choosimple at <a href="mailto:hello@choosimple.com">hello@choosimple.com</a>.</p>
